A lot of ingredients

00:02:48.083 --> 00:02:49.250
that should not be in bread.

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:49.500
Bread

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:50.041
should just be

00:02:50.041 --> 00:02:51.541
